     {"p": two("Arthur also meets strangers who offer side missions across the map, among them The Noblest of Men, and a Woman (the legendary gunslingers), The Smell of the Grease Paint, Geology for Beginners, A Test of Faith, The Iniquities of History, Oh, Brother, The Artist's Way, The Wisdom of the Elders and The Veteran.",
               "Arthur croise aussi des inconnus qui proposent des missions secondaires aux quatre coins de la carte, dont The Noblest of Men, and a Woman (les pistoleros légendaires), The Smell of the Grease Paint, Geology for Beginners, A Test of Faith, The Iniquities of History, Oh, Brother, The Artist's Way, The Wisdom of the Elders et The Veteran.")},
